# How to cite AaltoView. GitHub shows this as "Cite this repository".
# The DOI is Zenodo's CONCEPT DOI: it always resolves to the latest version.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you publish scientific work with data analysed or plotted using
  AaltoView, we would be grateful if you cited it as below.
title: "AaltoView: a viewer for N-dimensional measurement data"
type: software
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22959226
authors:
  - family-names: "Flajšman"
    given-names: "Lukáš"
    affiliation: "NanoSpin group, Aalto University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FlashLukas/AaltoView"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - data visualisation
  - netCDF
  - xarray
  - N-dimensional data
  - Origin
  - Jupyter
